{"id":"5630","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5630_main_thick-field-of-cirrus-fibratus-and-cirrus-uncinus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是实地发展的毛卷云厚云区。在图中<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">左侧的丝条几乎呈直线</span>，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在右侧变为不规则弯曲并相互缠绕</span>。卷云已开始变厚，但并未被确定为密云，因为丝条非常清晰且密度不足，没有呈灰色。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩云种的成簇卷云</span>正在下风边缘发展，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">短寿命的冰晶雨幡</span>正从地平线上的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小块高积云</span>中形成。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚，莫迪亚勒克","latitude":"纬度: 38° 0' 34'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 5' 8'' E","date":"07 December 2016 1134 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.1"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5630_syn_thick-field-of-cirrus-fibratus-and-cirrus-uncinus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>弱低压槽掠过该地区南部。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2016，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5630_upper_thick-field-of-cirrus-fibratus-and-cirrus-uncinus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测显示出从4800-6000米的中层水汽以及在8200米处的高层水汽尖峰。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4728_main_cirrus-fibratus-and-uncinus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>两种最常见的卷云云种的典型例子：毛状云和钩状云。两种云种都呈白色、细腻、头发状细丝；毛状云由近乎<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">笔直</span>的长丝和 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">或多或少不规则弯曲的</span>长丝组成。钩状云形状像一个逗号，并在 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩子</span>的顶部终止，在某些地方，终止于一个 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云簇</span>。 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">辐状淡积云</span>在地平线上较低，还存在于一些 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云和碎云</span>的云片。在拍摄这张照片的早晨，在夜间弱冷锋通过后，高云稳定增加。卷云在下午发展成为雾状卷层云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"英国伯克郡RG7雷丁附近的Stratfield Mortimer","latitude":"纬度: 51° 22' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 2' 24'' W","date":"25 June 2014 1026 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.1 4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.1 4"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4986_main_cirrus-fibratus-vertebratus-duplicatus-and-cumulus-humilis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>可以看到两层毛卷云。下层包括位于照片顶部<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">略微缠绕、不规则弯曲的细丝</span>和一条线，其中的细丝以类似于一侧<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">鱼骨架</span>的方式排列。后者是脊状云种。较高的一层由<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">几乎直的和一些不规则弯曲的细丝</span>组成。存在多个卷云云层表明其为复云云种。较低的、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">分离的圆形细胞且有阴影云底</span>的是淡积云。它们的垂直范围很小，但看起来并不像是扁平的。垂直方向的进一步发展可能会看到一些成为中积云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国梅登黑德白色沃尔瑟姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 29' 59'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 46' 4'' W","date":"14 June 2009 1107 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.1 5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.1 5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5002_main_cirrus-fibratus-radiatus-and-cumulus-humilis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>该图像的主要特征是从西北到东南方向排列的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一长带的毛卷云</span>，与观测到的西北风高度平行。各个纤维状细丝都<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横向于风</span>；它们呈现类似于椎骨、肋骨或鱼骨架的方式排列的外观。这是脊状云类。</p>\n<p>在卫星图像上，脊状毛卷云云带长900多公里。此图像中还有几个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">更小的云带</span>；所有的云带似乎都朝着<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地平线上的一个点</span>汇聚。这是辐状云附加特征。</p>\n<p>还存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云</span>，以及几个凝结尾迹（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">7</span>处）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国汉普郡SO20 6DE的Chilbolton Down","latitude":"纬度: 51° 7' 43'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 25' 12'' W","date":"27 June 2010 1514 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.1 30","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.1 30"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5629_main_cirrus-fibratus-and-floccus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>图中主要是近乎直线的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">很高且很细的毛卷云</span>丝条。图中右上角有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">模糊的絮状卷云</span>正在消散。图中右下有一个隐现的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">晴天碎积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚，阿斯彭代尔花园","latitude":"纬度: 37° 48' 37'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 57' 16'' E","date":"03 December 2016 1401 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.1 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.1 2"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4519_main_cirrus-uncinus-and-cirrus-fibratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc8\"><p>(注：12月的日期为估计值)</p>\n<p>天空几乎布满了钩卷云(<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>, <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>)和卷云<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">纤维状</span>云体。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5处</span>可见一片更明显、几乎呈积状的卷云，其高度似乎略低于其他云层。俄克拉荷马州中部位于高空延伸高压脊的北侧。</p></div>","copyright":"© C.A. Doswell","location":"Norman, Oklahoma, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 35° 13' 21'' N","longitude":"经度: 97° 26' 22'' W","date":"15 December 1973 1700 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4497_main_cirrus-fibratus-and-cirrostratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc9\"><p>高层云正非常缓慢地从西方侵入天空。现在这张向东拍摄的云层，相比前一晚（参见图像PR.79和PR.113）仅略微推进。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的前缘已几乎到达东方地平线。从那里，由纤维状元素（纤维状）组成的卷云在图中向上延伸，大约<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">至3</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处，那里开始出现连续的卷层云幕；这层云幕经天顶延伸至西方地平线。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">画面5</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>的顶部，观测到稀薄、中等大小、非纤维状的高积云元素。一道高压脊曾主导天气，但自前一晚以来，由于一个非常活跃的扰动（最初是热带气旋）从不列颠群岛方向逼近，气压一直在下降。</p></div>","copyright":"© A.J. Aalders","location":"Bussum, Netherlands","latitude":"纬度: 52° 16' 26'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 9' 59'' E","date":"17 September 1950 0629 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 6","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}